  "label": "User projected onto the child in cowboy attire",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the child, who is depicted in a prayerful pose. The child's innocent and reverent posture, combined with the cowboy attire, creates a humorous and ironic contrast with the satirical religious text. The user sees themselves as the child, embodying the role of the person praying in the text, which is an implicit projection of the user's identity onto the child figure.",
